# rustfmt.toml pins newline_style = "Unix" and tests/differential.rs diffs generated text against a
# checked-in .pest; Windows git would otherwise check out CRLF and fail both (CI 2026-09-11).
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes#_eol
* text=auto eol=lf
# corpus bytes are the oracle: never normalise endings. https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes#_text
corpus/* -text
